comments.content:
I think we should combine this and https://github.com/ubiquity/ubiquibot/issues/228 into one bounty. The two business problems to solve are 1. a custom message that partners can use to greet new hunters and 2. show a list of all of the bot commands that the hunter can invoke.
Perhaps we can make two config properties: 
1. `FIRST_TIME_CONTRIBUTOR_GREETING_MESSAGE`: string;
2. `FIRST_TIME_CONTRIBUTOR_GREETING_HELP_MENU`: boolean;
We should post the greeting first, and then the help menu, ideally in a single comment.

